# This project does NOT use .env for secrets. Never put a Gemini API key here.
# Any VITE_-prefixed variable is bundled into the public static build and is
# visible to anyone who opens the deployed site, so it must never hold a secret.
#
# The Gemini API key is entered by the user at runtime in Settings and kept
# only in memory (or, optionally, sessionStorage with an explicit warning).
# See README.md "Configuring Gemini" for details.

# Optional: override the Vite base path for local testing of a subpath deploy.
# The GitHub Actions workflow sets this automatically at build time; you do
# not normally need to set it yourself.
# VITE_BASE_PATH=/your-repo-name/

# Optional: override the public OSRM / Overpass / Photon endpoints used by the
# Smart Shopping routing feature. These are NOT secrets - they are public
# service URLs. Leave unset to use the documented public demo servers.
# VITE_OSRM_BASE_URL=https://router.project-osrm.org
# VITE_OVERPASS_BASE_URL=https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter
# VITE_PHOTON_BASE_URL=https://photon.komoot.io
